SKF Group. [Official catalogue PDF](https://cdn.skfmediahub.skf.com/api/public/0901d196802809de/pdf_preview_medium/Rolling_bearings_-_17000_1_EN_pdf_preview_medium.pdf). PUB BU/P1 17000/1 EN, October 2018, 1,152 PDF pages. The edition comes from the publication page, not the later PDF metadata.

Read the basics and selection chapters B.1–B.8 before a relevant bearing-family section. They connect arrangement, load/life, lubrication, temperature, fits and implementation. Product data describe their publication period; verify the exact present component separately.

Retrieved outside the repository on 30 October 2026. Cover, publication information, contents and selected arrangement/rating-life passages were inspected. The publisher provides free reading, with retained copyright and reproduction restrictions; this is not a Creative Commons textbook. All catalogue files remain external references.

